# Claude Code project config.
# Most .claude/ entries are masked device nodes in the agent sandbox and git
# cannot add them, so ignore everything and allowlist what we deliberately
# share. To track a real one later (e.g. .claude/commands/), add a '!' line.
# settings.local.json stays ignored on purpose: it is machine-local.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

